<p style="text-align: center;">My booth at Magnolia Summerfest</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Last weekend I set up my booth at Magnolia Summerfest in Seattle. This turned out to be a very pleasant show: lots of people attended, there was really good music (at least on Saturday) and weather in the low 70's both days.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">I really enjoy doing events like this: not only do I get to start the process of making relationships with new customers, I also meet a lot of people who live in the neighborhood, and artists in the local art community. I recommend all artists doing this at some point in their career.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Even though some paintings sold, I have plenty of works remaining, all of which are now available for sale in my online store. <a title="Online gallery and store" href="https://shop.portraitsbysimonbland.com/" target="_blank">https://shop.portraitsbysimonbland.com/</a></p>